        <mxCell id="proposal-input" value="&lt;b&gt;把粗图用于提出搜索位置&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;每条细射线读取邻近节点的多峰先验&lt;br&gt;细网格：64 × 112" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=20;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
